rf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Kendall County runs from 1951 to 2025, and June to July came in under 90% of normal in 43 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 154% of normal in June to July, then fell to 32% in October to November and 25% in November to December. So far in 2026, June to July came in at 215% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
